# Portable CPython for both venvs (included by the Makefile; also valid shell).
#
# python-build-standalone builds need only glibc >= 2.17, so venvs built from
# it on coe-hpc1 (CentOS 7) also run in COE-HPC3 jobs (Rocky 9). `make python`
# downloads it into .python/ and verifies the sha256. Change all three together;
# the venvs are rebuilt automatically.
#   https://github.com/astral-sh/python-build-standalone/releases/tag/20260924
PYTHON_VERSION=3.11.16
PBS_RELEASE=20260924
PBS_SHA256=49a52eb189878431a36efd137e7cd08f6429e59dc049b9cfb030bf706eb33fd4
